{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a delightful journey to uncover <strong>100 adorable cats</strong> hidden across a beautifully illustrated <strong>Shanghai</strong> setting. From bustling markets to serene gardens, every scene is brimming with details and feline surprises waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Shanghai</strong>: Dive into hand-drawn scenes inspired by Shanghai's vibrant culture and architecture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find All 100 Cats</strong>: Test your observation skills and uncover every hidden feline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Artwork</strong>: Start with monochromatic illustrations that fill with color as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay</strong>: Perfect for unwinding with calming visuals and lo-fi music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a cat lover or a fan of hidden object games, this cozy adventure will bring you joy and relaxation. Can you find them all? <strong>Start your search today!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Found 25 Cats!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3479680/b37ee7a556d2610d57c9b2d166ed2157213ab0e2.jpg"},{"name":"Found 50 Cats!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3479680/e0c0aae211d84d7f8478aa8b13edfc67a8f408cc.jpg"},{"name":"Found 75 Cats!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3479680/906b3e68ccc1b161176230dccc8a3889bfffb93b.jpg"},{"name":"Found 100 Cats!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3479680/fb21b1436a7a27a26d6e5595a6221fdb56e01c83.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/34796